sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant SPA as Angular SPA
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant UIS as User Identity Service
    participant AS as AuthorizationService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>SPA: Enter username/password
    SPA->>GW: POST /api/auth/login {username, password}
    Note over GW: AuthFilter intercepts login request
    GW->>UIS: POST /auth/token {username, password} (cloud provider API)
    UIS-->>GW: JWT token {sub, roles, exp}
    Note over GW: Token contains user identity and roles
    GW->>AS: Get user permissions (from JWT or DB lookup)
    AS->>DB: SELECT authorized_hotels FROM user_permissions WHERE user_id=X
    DB-->>AS: [hotel_1, hotel_3, hotel_5]
    AS-->>GW: Permission set
    GW->>GW: Enrich JWT with hotel permissions (custom claim)
    GW-->>SPA: HTTP 200 {access_token, user_info, authorized_hotels}
    SPA->>SPA: Store token in memory/session storage
    SPA-->>User: Display dashboard with authorized hotels

    Note over User,SPA: Subsequent requests include JWT
    User->>SPA: Select hotel and query prices
    SPA->>GW: GET /api/prices?hotelId=X (Authorization: Bearer <token>)
    Note over GW: AuthFilter validates JWT signature and expiry
    Note over GW: AuthorizationService checks hotel X is in user's authorized_hotels claim
    Note over GW: If authorized, forward request; if not, return 403 Forbidden